{0 Lwt filesystem execution}

{!Observe_fs_lwt.Make} completes portable filesystem delivery with Lwt and an
application-owned {!Observe_fs_lwt.Platform.S}. It adds promises, protected
waiters, worker ownership, and cancellation behavior without adding Unix or
[lwt.unix].

This is the intended Mirage composition point. Supply filesystem capabilities
from the target platform, apply the functor, and retain the returned worker so
the platform lifecycle can call [flush] and [shutdown].
